{"id":"H3266","lemma":"יְעוּשׁ","transliteration":"yeush","sayIt":"ye-ush","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jeush","meaning":"A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.5;\nson of: Esau (H6215) and Oholibamah (H0173);\nbrother of: Jalam (H3281) and Korah (H7141);\nhalf-brother of: Eliphaz (H0464) and Reuel (H7467)\nAlso named: ye.ish (יְעִישׁ \"Jeush\" H3274)\n§ Jehush or Jeush = \"He hurries to aid\"\n1) son of Eshek, a remote descendant of king Saul\n2) a Gershonite Levite of the house of Shimei\n3) son of king Rehoboam of Judah","glosses":["jeush"],"count":9,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush","kjv":"Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush","kjv":"and Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush","kjv":"Jehush"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush","kjv":"and Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"but Jeush","kjv":"but Jeush"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-11","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeush","kjv":"Jeush"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:5","note":"Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. These are the sons of Esau, who were born to him in the land of Canaan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:35","note":"The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 11:19","note":"She bore him sons: Jeush, Shemariah, and Zaham.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3189","lemma":"יַ֫חַת","transliteration":"yachat","gloss":"Jahath"},{"id":"H3274","lemma":"יְעִישׁ","transliteration":"yeish","gloss":"Jeush"},{"id":"H8096","lemma":"שִׁמְעִי","transliteration":"shimi","gloss":"Shimei"},{"id":"H0029","lemma":"אֲבִיָּה","transliteration":"aviyyah","gloss":"Abijah"},{"id":"H0164","lemma":"אֵהו